    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sha kūluhya luhya sha bamalaika mpungatī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nūbona shiiloleelo shingī ū ng'wigūlū, shalī shitaale no sha kūkumya. Bamalaika mpungatī baalī na sha kūluhya luhya mpungatī sha kūmalīgīja; nguno ū Mulungu akūmalīgīja musho ū būpelanu bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama hangī nūbona gītī nyanza y'ilole īsanganīkile na moto; nūbabona na a bapyeni abo bakīpyena ī shiinū nī shiikolile shayo nī lisaabu lyayo; baalī bīmīīla bīpīndya ī nyanza yenīyo, balī na ndono ja ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bīmbaga lyīmbo lya ng'wa Musa ū ntūmami wa ng'wa Mulungu, na lya Ng'wana wa Ng'holo. Bīmbaga balīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yabīta ī yenīyo nūbona yalugūlwa ī hekalu ya ng'wigūlū, ūmo būkikalaga būkaanīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būfuma a bamalaika mpungatī abo baalī na sha kūluhya luhya mpungatī; baalī na shizwalo shilabagīzu sha kitaani yape; ū mu shikuba baalī bitungile mishipi ya zahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmò wa Shiseeng'wa shipanga ī shine ūbinha a bamalaika mpungatī benabo nzweso mpungatī ja zahabu; jokalile būpelanu bo ng'wa Mulungu, ūyo alī mpanga kūshisha welelo bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī hekalu yokala lyochi ly'ikūjo lya ng'wa Mulungu na būdūla bokwe; walī atīho nūūlū ūmò wa kūdūla kwingīla ū mu hekalu, kūshisha shishile ī sha kūluhya luhya mpungatī sha bamalaika mpungatī benabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
